            <ArticleTitle>Transient right bundle branch block and left anterior hemiblock during Prinzmetal's angina.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>419-21</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of transient right bundle branch block with left anterior hemiblock during Prinzmetal's angina is reported. Selective coronary arteriography revealed 90% narrowing on the proximal left anterior descending coronary artery; the left ventriculogram was normal. Transient ischemia of the proximal His-Purkinje system is the probable mechanism of this pattern.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
